flowchart TB
  accTitle: Branches narrow the checker’s view of Booking
  accDescr: A Booking starts as a union. A pending branch returns a waiting message. Otherwise a confirmed branch can read specialistId, leaving cancelled with reason on the final path.
  U["Booking union
static starting type"] --> P{"status = pending?"}
  P -->|Yes| A["Pending variant
return waiting message"]
  P -->|No: two variants remain| C{"status = confirmed?"}
  C -->|Yes| B["Confirmed variant
return specialistId"]
  C -->|No| D["Cancelled variant
return reason"]
  class U,P,C control;
  class A,B,D success;

  classDef control fill:#F5F3FF,stroke:#7C3AED,color:#111827;
  classDef neutral fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#4B5563,color:#111827;
  classDef success fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#15803D,color:#111827;
  classDef pending fill:#FFFBEB,stroke:#B45309,color:#111827;
  classDef failure fill:#FEE2E2,stroke:#B91C1C,color:#111827;
